# Stack

- Next.js App Router only; the only extra dependency is `@supabase/supabase-js`
- Data lives in Supabase PostgreSQL (9 tables, schema in `supabase/migrations/`);
  all reads/writes go through `lib/db.ts` (`readDb`/`writeDb`) using
  `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL` + `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` via `lib/supabase.ts`
- Without those env vars (local dev only) `lib/db.ts` falls back to `data/db.json`
- HTTP API: `GET/POST /api/items`, `PATCH/DELETE /api/items/[id]` + bank/auth/admin routes
- UI is RTL Persian in `app/page.tsx`
- Production: Vercel, auto-deploys from `main` (`https://mostafaapp.vercel.app`)
- Do not add libraries; do not add RLS/auth systems (per project owner's rules)
